fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"applib/gstappsrc.html#GstAppSrcNeedDataCallback","fragment":"\n\tGstAppSrcNeedDataCallback\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSrcNeedDataCallback\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSrcNeedDataCallback\n\nCalled when the appsrc needs more data. A buffer or EOS should be pushed to\nappsrc from this thread or another thread. length is just a hint and when it\nis set to -1, any number of bytes can be pushed into appsrc.\nParameters:\na GstAppSrc\nLength hint\ncallback user data\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nCalled when the appsrc needs more data. A buffer or EOS should be pushed to\nappsrc from this thread or another thread. length is just a hint and when it\nis set to -1, any number of bytes can be pushed into appsrc.\nParameters:\na GstApp.AppSrc\nLength hint\ncallback user data\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nCalled when the appsrc needs more data. A buffer or EOS should be pushed to\nappsrc from this thread or another thread. length is just a hint and when it\nis set to -1, any number of bytes can be pushed into appsrc.\nParameters:\na GstApp.AppSrc\nLength hint\ncallback user data\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});